    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABOHpZXg",
      "title": "ci: add agent approval check",
      "author": "falcorocks",
      "number": 1617,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds an `agent-approval-check` workflow that calls the reusable ethereum-optimism/factory `.github/workflows/agent-approval-check.yaml`, pinned to ethereum-optimism/factory@feec17f6a55c3bd2dd1f0f0459e942688489222f. It reports the `agent-approval-check` commit status on pull requests, reviews, `/approve` comments and merge groups. Pull requests authored by, approved by, or containing commits from agent and automation identities stay pending until two distinct human reviewers with write access approve the current head.\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-10T13:56:03Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-10T16:27:12Z",
      "additions": 19,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABOJqLFg",
      "title": "chore: make cloud-security code owner of GitHub Actions inputs",
      "author": "falcorocks",
      "number": 1618,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nMakes `@ethereum-optimism/cloud-security` the sole code owner of the GitHub Actions inputs: `.github/workflows/`, `.github/actions/`, `.github/scripts/` and the CODEOWNERS file itself.\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-10T16:09:11Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-10T17:29:13Z",
      "additions": 6,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABOKEs0w",
      "title": "sep/118, eth/087: set l2ForkHeadLag for Soneium fee vault tasks",
      "author": "claude",
      "number": 1619,
      "body": "<!-- claude-slack-attribution -->\n_Requested via [Slack thread](https://oplabs-pbc.slack.com/archives/C03N11M0BBN/p1794328082875429)_\n\n## Summary\n\n**Before:** `stacked_simulation_sep` and `stacked_simulation_eth` fail intermittently because `sep/118-soneium-minato-fee-vault` and `eth/087-soneium-fee-vault` fork the load-balanced Soneium L2 RPCs (`rpc.minato.soneium.org`, `rpc.soneium.org`) at head: one backend reports a head block that the backend serving the next request doesn't have yet. CircleCI job 220988 failed with `failed to get block for block number: 35566871; latest block number: 35566871`; job 220877 failed with `error code -32001: block not found`.\n\n**After:** Both tasks fork the L2 preflight 5 blocks behind head, the same as the Unichain tasks in #1581. Config only; calldata and hashes are unchanged.\n\n**How:** Adds `l2ForkHeadLag = 5` to `src/tasks/sep/118-soneium-minato-fee-vault/config.toml` and `src/tasks/eth/087-soneium-fee-vault/config.toml`, using the opt-in key added in #1581. The lag only affects the L2 preflight reads; the L1 fork and the main simulation are unchanged, so calldata and domain/message hashes stay the same. No framework code changes.\n\n---\n\n## For Task PRs\n\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/sep/118-soneium-minato-fee-vault`, `src/tasks/eth/087-soneium-fee-vault`\n\n**Tenderly simulation link**: N/A. Only the L2 pre-flight fork block moves; L1 transactions, calldata and domain/message hashes are unchanged.\n\n---\n\n## Additional context\n\nSame fix as #1581 for the Unichain tasks, applied per task as agreed in that PR's review.\n\n---\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PAqwYJBHCoGKFCcahxZZE7\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-10T16:37:18Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-10T19:15:42Z",
      "additions": 2,
      "deletions": 0
    }
  ],
